asl-sentence--end-pos 4#/4 400 72145 1344 32 ;.
asl-sentence-end-punctuation $ . ;.
$.#407
|  Image-analysis tactics such as texture
|  segmentation, occlusion compensation, and gradient-vector inference
|  have detailed mathematical formulae that could offer functional insights into
|  visual perception (even if computer implementations may
.  be very different from brains')
asl-sentence-text $# 407 ;.

asl-new-sentence 4# 401 ;.
