asl-sentence--end-pos 4#/4 401 72384 1348 27 ;.
asl-sentence-end-punctuation $ . ;.
$.#408
|  Postordering and type-checking are
|  not at the same level of quantitative sophistication,
|  so we don't necessarily move a theoretical needle very far
